  "currentWritePolicy": "B049 AddendumF server-first: Hugo4 and Window4 both use the next ordinary Classic position (clamped at ten), including its stock, level descriptor, coin factor, unused-stock bonus and normal level-clear reward. The run then plays that same ordinary next position; no board is skipped or renumbered. Fresh seed domains distinguish new mechanics. Historical Hugo1/2, local prepared-never-deployed Hugo3, and Window1/2/3 retain exact seeds, stock and scoring. Eight deployed historical authorities remain byte-exact;0a87 Hugo3 is archived only as superseded-never-deployed, not authority9. Current Classic remains level-v3; old Classic clear-v2 writes reject UPDATE_GAME_REQUIRED; Daily/Warp clear-v2 unchanged. Row version remains6.23. NO migration or SQL reapply; confirmed livev10 read-kind whitelist retained; no database execution."
